### Set base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Read all notifications of a member
GET {{baseUrl}}/members/1/notifications

### Read all notifications read of a member
GET {{baseUrl}}/members/1/notifications?read=true

### Read all notifications unread of a member
GET {{baseUrl}}/members/1/notifications?read=false

### Try to get notifications of a non-existent member (should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/members/999/notifications



### Send a notification to a member
POST {{baseUrl}}/members/1/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "RESULT",
  "message": "Match gagné 3-1",
  "sendDate": "2026-03-05T12:30:00"
}

### Send a notification to a member
POST {{baseUrl}}/members/1/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "RESULT",
  "message": "Match gagné 3-9",
  "sendDate": "2026-03-05T12:30:00"
}

### Try to send a notification with empty message (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/members/1/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "TOURNAMENT",
  "message": "",
  "sendDate": "2026-03-05T12:30:00"
}

### Try to send a notification to a non-existent member (should return 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/members/999/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "RESULT",
  "message": "Test membre inconnu",
  "sendDate": "2026-03-05T12:30:00"
}

### Mark a notification as read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/members/1/notifications/1

### Try to mark a non-existent member (should return 404)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/members/1/notifications/2